	| Perpetual               | false                    | |
	| Quantity                | 1                        | |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       | |
	| Status                  | Approved                 | |
	And I log into the customer homepage as "${staticCustomerAdminEmailAddress}" with password "${staticCustomerAdminPassword}"
	Then I should be able to view the following project "Korcst - ${staticProjectName}" values in the customer project details page
	| Name           | Korcst - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code           | KORCSTKORCST                  |
	| State          | ACTIVE                        |
	| Support Region | United States                 |
	| SLA            | -                             |
	| Support Seats  | 0 / 0 Filled                  |
	| Tier           | T1                            |
	| FLS Partner    | -                             |
    When I assign the contact with the email address "cstm.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Korcst - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| Support Requester |
	And I click on the "Contacts" tab
	Then I should be able to view the contact with the email address "cstm.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Name          | CSTM customer1                       |
	| Email Address | cstm.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Role          | Support Requester                    |
	| User Status   | VERIFIED                             |

